<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-WESTERN PROVINCE 278-4 AT TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WESTERN PROVINCE 278-4 AT TEA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Province were 278 for four at tea, needing a further to beat Transvaal on the final day of the Supersport Series match at the Wanderers.</p>
<p>Scores: Transvaal 371 and 263-8 declared.</p>
<p>Western Province 227 and 278-4 (Herschelle Gibbs 103, H.D.Ackerman 122 not out).</p>
